relay	UNKNOWN STEP	   "status:in-progress" and leave your own agent:* label in
relay	UNKNOWN STEP	   place, so nothing else gets triggered on this issue
relay	UNKNOWN STEP	   until they reply.
relay	UNKNOWN STEP	7. If you learned something durable — a pattern, a gotcha,
relay	UNKNOWN STEP	   an architectural decision — append it to your MEMORY.md.
relay	UNKNOWN STEP	   Keep entries short and dated.
